                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "NOT RECOMMENDED\r\n\r\n- This game can give u headache, the camera rotate to fast, the motion and if u want to play the legal way need to \"remember\" the levels. U have a run for 11 min\r\n\r\nI had this game for few years i tried to completed all the achievements.\r\nI completed on the legit way but a little tricky, if u have a console like a SteamDeck u can pause the game, rotate the console and u have the normal view, pause again and continue all the time.\r\nFor the \"ranked mode\" u need to run near to 11 min with 50 seconds\r\nIf u change the console to sleep mode and continue late the game will not detect the controller, u need to close and open the game, that happen to me doing the 500 retries. \r\nI set the computer on the game with a clicker for that achievement",
